# Add a row to det_generator.cpp's IDENTITY_TABLE (see the snippet in that file),
# raise DET_IDENTITY_SLOTS and FLEET_MAX, add a MAC to beacon_tx_raw.cpp, then
# paste its DET + public key below:
#
# <DET_HEX 32 chars>              <PUBKEY_HEX 64 chars>
